<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 75.1500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.1500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange om Tuesday after</p>
<p>75.4500 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Mar 25		  Mar 24</p>
<p> High			     75.1000		 75.0600</p>
<p> Low				75.2000		 75.4500</p>
<p> Open			     75.1000		 75.0600</p>
<p> Close			    75.1500		 75.4500</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     4.165		   2.710</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
